                 Apple's XNU (xnu-8796.121.2).
  everything else  MIT (LICENSE).

Third-party code: none is copied into this repository. Register addresses, field layouts and the
order of hardware steps were read from the phone itself (its live device tree, over adb) and from
public sources, which are named where they are used:
  - MediaTek's Linux drivers as published by Xiaomi (github.com/MiCode/Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource,
    branch merlin-r-oss, and github.com/MiCode/MTK_kernel_modules) -- GPL-2.0; read, not copied.
  - Linux mainline (drivers/mmc/host/mtk-sd.c, drivers/gpu/drm/panfrost) -- GPL-2.0; read, not copied.

Not in this repository, by design (LEGAL.md): any file of iOS, any vendor firmware (pulled from the
user's own phone by pull-firmware.sh), any image of the phone, any screenshot.
